{"id":"558cfa8109ae83cc","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertParams.md","title":"HilbertParams","display":"HilbertParams","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"HilbertParams","parameters":["A","R"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"HilbertParams"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>A</span><span>R</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：参数化 Hilbert 演算。有序参数：<code>A</code>、<code>R</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ HilbertParams A R)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ FormsC A)\n  (and\n    (@ Rel R)\n    (forall q\n      (implies\n        (in q R)\n        (exists P\n          (exists a\n            (exists n\n              (and\n                (@ Pair P a q)\n                (and (@ Seq P n) (and (forall i (implies (in i n) (exists b (and (@ App P i b) (@ FmC b))))) (@ FmC a)))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"43d22035e7796b1d\" href=\"?note=43d22035e7796b1d\" title=\"ZFC_FmC\">FmC</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c0c9a9379a527254\" href=\"?note=c0c9a9379a527254\" title=\"ZFC_FormsC\">FormsC</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0111fd5e22d5034a\" href=\"?note=0111fd5e22d5034a\" title=\"ZFC_Rel\">Rel</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ HilbertParams A R)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmC|FmC]]；[[ZFC_FormsC|FormsC]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Rel|Rel]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FmC","status":"resolved","id":"43d22035e7796b1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmC|FmC]]；[[ZFC_FormsC|FormsC]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Rel|Rel]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FormsC","status":"resolved","id":"c0c9a9379a527254","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmC|FmC]]；[[ZFC_FormsC|FormsC]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Rel|Rel]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Pair","status":"resolved","id":"0a7fe33bb2e95221","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmC|FmC]]；[[ZFC_FormsC|FormsC]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Rel|Rel]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Rel","status":"resolved","id":"0111fd5e22d5034a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location